TITLE:: CompressorMeterView
summary:: in, the gain change and out, as bars
categories:: Libraries>Compressor
related:: Classes/Compressor, Classes/CompressorPanel

DESCRIPTION::
FxMeter (from ParaEQ) with its gain bar: in, the gain change, out, on the dB
scale the history and the curve share. A cut hangs from 0 dB, a lift rises
from the floor, in orchid; in and out are blue with clip lights. The held
peaks are numbers over the bars (the gain to one decimal); a click drops them
and the clip lights. Levels that stop coming fall to nothing rather than
standing at the last reply.

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: new
ARGUMENT:: comp

INSTANCEMETHODS::

METHOD:: comp
METHOD:: isLive
METHOD:: inLevel
The compressor's input peak while replies come, else 0.
METHOD:: outLevel
